flowchart TD
  A[CSV readings + optional metadata/weather/occupancy] --> B[Authenticated multipart POST /api/v1/imports]
  B --> C[Create batch; hash every uploaded file]
  C --> D[Identify dataset and map building/meter]
  D --> E[Validate schema, timestamps, units, license and mappings]
  E -->|invalid rows| R[Persist rejected-row reasons and report]
  E -->|valid rows| N[Normalize units and timestamps; preserve raw provenance]
  N --> T[Transactional organization-scoped persistence]
  T --> Q[Quality counts, progress and batch status]
  Q --> H[Import history / batch detail / rejection CSV]
  R --> H
